The program calculates:

Wellness

Wellness Score =
Sleep Quality
+ Reverse Soreness
+ Reverse Fatigue
+ Reverse Stress

Maximum:
20
Minimum:
4

Readiness

Readiness (%) =
Wellness Score / 20 × 100
For example, if:
Sleep = 5
Soreness = 1
Fatigue = 1
Stress = 1
then:
Reverse Soreness = 5
Reverse Fatigue  = 5
Reverse Stress   = 5

Wellness = 5 + 5 + 5 + 5
         = 20

Readiness = 20 / 20 × 100
          = 100%